//! The icon set.
//!
//! Every glyph is a [Solar](https://solar-icons.dev) icon in the **Bold** style,
//! converted from the original SVG into a mirui `path!` literal: the vector data
//! lives in the program image, so there is no image decoding, no texture atlas
//! and no file system access at run time.
//!
//! The icons are drawn on Solar's 24x24 grid, which is also mirui's default
//! icon view box. `tools/solar_to_mirui.py` regenerates this file from the
//! upstream SVGs.
//!
//! Solar Icons by 480 Design, licensed under CC BY 4.0. See `assets/LICENSES`.

